{"4290750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wacky Coursers", "steam_appid": 4290750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run fast. Fall faster. Laugh the hardest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Wacky Coursers</strong>, a chaotic parkour racing game where skill helps… but nonsense usually wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint, jump, slip, get launched, flipped upside down, and somehow still make it to the finish line. Courses are packed with swinging hammers 🔨, spinning shredders ⚙️, moving platforms 🧱, and obstacles that seem personally offended by your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into <strong>mystery tubes</strong> 🌀 and pop out in completely unexpected places. Helpful? Maybe. Terrifying? Definitely. Then suddenly—gravity flips 🙃 and now the floor is the ceiling. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab <strong>powerups</strong> ⚡ to cause even more chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐜 <strong>Shrink</strong> to sneak under obstacles like a tiny speed goblin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💪 <strong>Size Up</strong> to kick obstacles out of your way like you totally meant to do that</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sections even give you <strong>wings</strong> 🪽 and turn the race into a flappy-style flying challenge through tight pipes. Yes, it’s stressful. Yes, it’s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race <strong>solo</strong> against the clock ⏱️ or jump into <strong>online multiplayer</strong> 🌍 to watch your friends fail in real time (and fail yourself just as spectacularly).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic character and unlock <strong>customization options</strong> 🎨 as you progress, because looking ridiculous while losing is still winning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Fast, chaotic <strong>parkour racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 Designed for <strong>funny fails &amp; clutch wins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👤 <strong>Single-player time trials</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Online multiplayer races</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Surprise tubes that send you who-knows-where</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🙃 Gravity-flipping sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪽 Winged flappy-style flying challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Wacky powerups: shrink &amp; smash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👕 Character customization through progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wacky Coursers</strong>, the fastest runner doesn’t always win — but everyone has a good time falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to trip, flip, fly, and somehow win? 🚀</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run fast. Fall faster. Laugh the hardest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Wacky Coursers</strong>, a chaotic parkour racing game where skill helps… but nonsense usually wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint, jump, slip, get launched, flipped upside down, and somehow still make it to the finish line. Courses are packed with swinging hammers 🔨, spinning shredders ⚙️, moving platforms 🧱, and obstacles that seem personally offended by your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into <strong>mystery tubes</strong> 🌀 and pop out in completely unexpected places. Helpful? Maybe. Terrifying? Definitely. Then suddenly—gravity flips 🙃 and now the floor is the ceiling. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab <strong>powerups</strong> ⚡ to cause even more chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐜 <strong>Shrink</strong> to sneak under obstacles like a tiny speed goblin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💪 <strong>Size Up</strong> to kick obstacles out of your way like you totally meant to do that</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sections even give you <strong>wings</strong> 🪽 and turn the race into a flappy-style flying challenge through tight pipes. Yes, it’s stressful. Yes, it’s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race <strong>solo</strong> against the clock ⏱️ or jump into <strong>online multiplayer</strong> 🌍 to watch your friends fail in real time (and fail yourself just as spectacularly).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic character and unlock <strong>customization options</strong> 🎨 as you progress, because looking ridiculous while losing is still winning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Fast, chaotic <strong>parkour racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 Designed for <strong>funny fails &amp; clutch wins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👤 <strong>Single-player time trials</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Online multiplayer races</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Surprise tubes that send you who-knows-where</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🙃 Gravity-flipping sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪽 Winged flappy-style flying challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Wacky powerups: shrink &amp; smash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👕 Character customization through progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wacky Coursers</strong>, the fastest runner doesn’t always win — but everyone has a good time falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to trip, flip, fly, and somehow win? 🚀</strong></p>", "short_description": "Wacky Coursers is a chaotic parkour racing game where you run, jump, shrink, smash, flip gravity 🙃, fly with wings 🪽, and get launched through surprise tubes 🌀. Race solo or online—and laugh your way to the finish! 🏁😄", "supported_lan